      ],
      "question_type": "约束极值进阶题",
      "method": [
        "参数化后求导找临界点，比较端点"
      ],
      "solution_steps": [
        "参数化",
        "求导",
        "解临界点",
        "比较各点函数值确定最值"
      ],
      "math_structure": {
        "type": "constrained_extremum_on_arc",
        "template": "h(x,y)=2x^3+y^3 \\text{ s.t. } x^2+y^2=1,0\\le x,y\\le1",
        "variable_count": 2
      },
      "difficulty": 3,
      "estimated_minutes": 10,
      "answer": [
        {
          "label": "结果",
          "steps": [
            "令 $x=\\cos\\theta,y=\\sin\\theta$，得 $h(\\theta)=2\\cos^3\\theta+\\sin^3\\theta$。求导：$h'(\\theta)=-6\\cos^2\\theta\\sin\\theta+3\\sin^2\\theta\\cos\\theta=3\\sin\\theta\\cos\\theta(\\sin\\theta-2\\cos\\theta)$。",
            "临界点：$\\theta=0,\\ \\theta=\\pi/2$，或 $\\tan\\theta=2\\Rightarrow \\sin\\theta=\\tfrac{2}{\\sqrt5},\\cos\\theta=\\tfrac{1}{\\sqrt5}$。",
            "计算函数值：$\\theta=0$：$h=2$；$\\theta=\\pi/2$：$h=1$；$\\tan\\theta=2$：$h=2\\left(\\tfrac{1}{\\sqrt5}\\right)^3+\\left(\\tfrac{2}{\\sqrt5}\\right)^3=\\tfrac{2}{5\\sqrt5}+\\tfrac{8}{5\\sqrt5}=\\tfrac{2\\sqrt5}{5}\\approx0.894$。",
            "分析符号变化知临界点为局部极小值。比较三值 $2,1,\\tfrac{2\\sqrt5}{5}$，最大值为 $2$（点$(1,0)$），最小值为 $\\tfrac{2\\sqrt5}{5}$（点$(\\tfrac1{\\sqrt5},\\tfrac2{\\sqrt5})$）。"
          ]
        }
      ],
